\eqn{\delta_i} of the units are integrated out: the likelihood of the
trajectory \eqn{i} has the closed form
\deqn{\ell_i = \sum_j \frac{1}{2}\ln\frac{\eta \Delta t_j^2}{2\pi \Delta x_{ij}^3}
